## 5️⃣ Quick sanity‑check with the CLI (optional but handy)

```bash
# Install the binary (once)
curl -L https://github.com/protomaps/go-pmtiles/releases/download/v2.5.0/pmtiles-linux-amd64 -o pmtiles && chmod +x pmtiles

# Show what layers/zoom range the archive contains
./pmtiles show https://my-cdn.example.com/tiles/world.pmtiles
```

The output will list:

```
bounds: -180,-85,180,85
minzoom: 0
maxzoom: 14
layers: water,road,building,landuse,...
```

Use those layer names in the `source-layer` property of your style.

